- LocalNutrition/Resources/foods.json — food composition data from the
  Standard Tables of Food Composition in Japan 2020 (Eighth Revised Edition),
  Supplement 2023, Ministry of Education, Culture, Sports, Science and
  Technology, Japan (「日本食品標準成分表（八訂）増補2023年から引用」).
  Free use with citation of the source, as stated by MEXT.
